🔥 30 BEFORE 30 — HARSHIT EDITION (`30-before-30`)

💰 WEALTH, BUSINESS & REAL-WORLD VENTURES
💰 01. Financial Growth & Security

☐ ₹10+ LPA salary achieve karna
 ↳ ☐ Salary ko ₹15+ LPA tak le jaana (through tech upskilling / product roles)
 ↳ ☐ 6 months ka living expenses emergency fund banana (Liquid FD / High-yield savings)
 ↳ ☐ Regular investing system set karna (Monthly SIP in Index Funds + Multicap)
 ↳ ☐ Ek din ₹0-spend day challenge try karna (mindful spending reset)

💻 02. Digital Side Income & Product

☐ Ek sustainable side-income source establish karna
 ↳ ☐ Apna pehla product / micro-SaaS / digital asset launch karna
 ↳ ☐ First ₹10,000 online income earn karna
 ↳ ☐ Freelancing / consulting / digital product sales ko consistent banana

🏢 03. Offline Real-World Venture ("My Own Thing")

☐ Ek physical offline venture plan karke kickstart karna
 ↳ ☐ Pick domain: Gym / Fitness Studio | Boutique Stay/Hostel | School/Academy | Cafe/Shop
 ↳ ☐ Business model & location finalize karna (e.g. Manali, Rishikesh, Goa, or Hometown)
 ↳ ☐ Grand opening / First 50 real offline customers serve karna

🚀 04. Real-World Tech Product (100+ Active Users)

☐ Ek live tech project build karke launch karna
 ↳ ☐ Production deployment (Vercel / AWS / Railway)
 ↳ ☐ First 10 paying / active users onboard karna
 ↳ ☐ 100+ real users milestone cross karna with active feedback loop

🏔️ HIGH-OCTANE ADVENTURE & OUTDOORS
🏔️ 05. Himalayan & Mountain Adventure

☐ Himalayas mein high-altitude trek & camping experience
 ↳ 📍 Top Spots: Kedarkantha / Har Ki Dun (Snow summit), Hampta Pass (Spiti crossover), Rupin Pass, Chadar Trek (Ladakh)
 ↳ ☐ 3+ day high-altitude trek (12,000+ ft)
 ↳ ☐ Glacier / snow summit reach karna
 ↳ ☐ Night trek / Waterfall trek (Kalsubai night trek, Rajmachi, Dudhsagar falls)
 ↳ ☐ High-altitude tent camping & summit sunrise

🪂 06. Skydiving

☐ Airplane se jump karke freefall experience karna
 ↳ 📍 Top Spots (India): Narnaul Airstrip (Haryana), Deesa (Gujarat), Mysore (Karnataka)
 ↳ 📍 Top Spots (Global): Skydive Dubai (Palm Dropzone), Pattaya (Thailand), Interlaken (Switzerland)
 ↳ ☐ Tandem skydive from 10,000–13,000 ft
 ↳ ☐ Sunrise / sunset jump slot if available
 ↳ ☐ 4K video & photos preserve karna

🪢 07. Bungee Jumping

☐ Highest certified safe jump face karna
 ↳ 📍 Top Spots (India): Jumpin Heights, Rishikesh (83m over Hyul river), Mayem Lake (Goa - 55m)
 ↳ 📍 Top Spots (Global): Nevis Highwire (Queenstown, NZ - 134m), Bloukrans Bridge (South Africa - 216m)
 ↳ ☐ Rishikesh 83m jump complete karna
 ↳ ☐ Overcome hesitation before stepping onto the plank

🌊 08. White-Water Rafting

☐ Grade III/IV wild rapids raft karna
 ↳ 📍 Top Spots (India): Rishikesh (Marine Drive to NIM Beach — Rapids: The Wall, Roller Coaster), Zanskar River Expedition (Ladakh), Kundalika River (Kolad)
 ↳ ☐ 16km–26km continuous rafting route
 ↳ ☐ Cliff jumping & body surfing in the river

🤿 09. Scuba Diving & PADI Certification

☐ Open ocean coral reef dive & scuba certification
 ↳ 📍 Top Spots (India): Havelock & Neil Island (Andaman), Netrani Island (Karnataka), Kadmat/Bangaram (Lakshadweep)
 ↳ 📍 Top Spots (Global): Koh Tao / Similan Islands (Thailand), Tulamben Shipwreck (Bali), Red Sea (Egypt)
 ↳ ☐ PADI / SSI Open Water Diver certification complete karna
 ↳ ☐ Underwater marine life & sea turtles experience with video

🎈 10. Aerial Adventures (Paragliding, Ballooning & Zipline)

☐ Hawa mein flight & high-speed aerial flight
 ↳ 📍 Paragliding: Bir Billing (HP - 2nd highest in world), Pokhara (Nepal)
 ↳ 📍 Hot-Air Ballooning: Jaipur / Pushkar (Rajasthan dawn flights), Cappadocia (Turkey)
 ↳ 📍 Ziplining: Flying Fox Mehrangarh Fort (Jodhpur), Shivpuri (Rishikesh)
 ↳ ☐ Bir Billing tandem flight (20-30 mins thermal soaring)
 ↳ ☐ Hot-air balloon sunrise flight
 ↳ ☐ Multi-line mega zipline course

🏄 11. Learn Extreme Sports (Surf, Ski & Canyoneer)

☐ Ek technical adventure sport learn & perform karna
 ↳ 📍 Snowboarding / Skiing: Gulmarg (Kashmir Phase 2 @ 13,050 ft), Solang / Sethan (Manali), Auli (Uttarakhand)
 ↳ 📍 Surfing: Mulki (Mantra Surf Club, Karnataka), Varkala / Kovalam (Kerala), Weligama (Sri Lanka)
 ↳ 📍 Canyoning & Caving: Cherrapunji / Nongriat (Meghalaya), Vashisht (Manali)
 ↳ 📍 Bouldering / Climbing: Hampi (World bouldering hub), Badami (Karnataka)
 ↳ ☐ Minimum 3-day coaching / workshop complete karna

🏕️ 12. Wilderness, Safari & Marine Life

☐ Deep jungle, desert & ocean wildlife experience
 ↳ 📍 Jungle Tiger Safari: Jim Corbett (Uttarakhand), Ranthambore (Rajasthan), Kaziranga (Assam), Bandhavgarh (MP)
 ↳ 📍 Desert Camp: Sam Sand Dunes / Khuri (Jaisalmer - Thar Desert dune bashing + night stargazing)
 ↳ 📍 Whale & Dolphin Watching: Mirissa / Trincomalee (Sri Lanka - Blue whales), Palolem / Grand Island (Goa)
 ↳ ☐ Tiger / Rhino spotting on an open gypsy safari
 ↳ ☐ Overnight tent camping in deep wilderness with bonfire
 ↳ ☐ Dolphin / Whale encounter in the open sea

🌍 TRAVEL, CULTURE & EXPLORATION
